T('mammamia','Mamma Mia!',2008,'1h 48m','PG-13','ABBA sunshine cannon',['Joyful','Campy','Sunny','Romantic'],['Jukebox','Pop','ABBA'],[4.6,4.5,4.8,3.8,5,4.7,3.8,5,4.8,5],'Familiar hooks, communal singing, shameless joy, and almost no resistance to singing along.','Narrative integration is intentionally loose.',['Dancing Queen','Mamma Mia','The Winner Takes It All'],['moulin','hairspray','rockofages'],'film','jukebox',['pop','ensemble','character belt'],2,82,4.5,5,5,['comfort','sunshine','sing-along'],['loose narrative integration'],[('Dancing Queen','pure communal lift'),('The Winner Takes It All','emotional belt')],'Essential comfort-plus-hooks reference point.'),
T('soundmusic','The Sound of Music',1965,'2h 52m','G','Warmth with a spine',['Warm','Expansive','Tender','Triumphant'],['Golden Age','Orchestral','Folk'],[3.8,4,3.8,4.6,5,3.6,4.8,4.7,5,5],'An enduring comfort anchor with melodies that become emotional geography.','Long runtime and gentler propulsion.',['Do-Re-Mi','My Favorite Things','Climb Ev’ry Mountain'],['annie','westside','moana'],'film','adaptation',['legit','ensemble','orchestral'],2,70,4.8,5,5,['comfort','nostalgia','warmth'],['long runtime','gentle pacing'],[('My Favorite Things','comfort hook'),('Climb Ev’ry Mountain','cathartic payoff')],'Adds classic comfort without maximalist dependence.'),
T('grease','Grease',1978,'1h 50m','PG','Hooks in a leather jacket',['Playful','Nostalgic','Flirty','Energetic'],['Rock and Roll','Pop','Broadway'],[4.7,4.4,5,3.4,4.7,4.5,3.5,5,4.4,5],'An almost absurd concentration of recognizable hooks and movement energy.','Some character and gender dynamics have aged poorly.',['Summer Nights','Hopelessly Devoted to You','You’re the One That I Want'],['hairspray','mammamia','rockofages'],'film','adaptation',['pop','rock and roll','ensemble'],2,80,4,5,5,['sing-along','nostalgia','movement'],['dated gender dynamics'],[('You’re the One That I Want','duet propulsion'),('Summer Nights','ensemble hook density')],'Important familiarity-driven sing-along benchmark.'),
T('burlesque','Burlesque',2010,'1h 59m','PG-13','Vocals first, subtlety never',['Glossy','Sexy','Belty','Campy'],['Pop','Burlesque','Dance'],[4.5,5,4.8,3.5,3.8,5,3.2,4.8,4.2,4.6],'Big voices, stage spectacle, dance, and unapologetic performance energy.','Story exists mostly to move between numbers.',['Show Me How You Burlesque','Bound to You','Express'],['moulin','chicago','dreamgirls'],'film','original',['power belt','pop','diva vocal'],2,72,4.1,4.5,3,['belt-along','glamour','performance'],['thin narrative'],[('Show Me How You Burlesque','maximum stage energy'),('Bound to You','vocal catharsis')],'Useful test of whether vocal spectacle can outweigh narrative weakness.'),
T('pitchperfect','Pitch Perfect',2012,'1h 52m','PG-13','Competitive harmony dopamine',['Funny','Hooky','Competitive','Communal'],['A cappella','Pop','Mashup'],[4.6,4.5,4.8,3.4,4.6,4.2,3.5,5,4.5,5],'Mashups, recognizable pop, ensemble chemistry, and performance stakes create musical propulsion without traditional musical storytelling.','Songs are performances rather than narrative speech.',['Cups','Bellas Finals','Riff Off'],['kpop','sister2','mammamia'],'film','music-performance',['a cappella','pop','ensemble'],2,62,3.8,5,5,['funny','communal','easy replay'],['not a traditional musical'],[('Bellas Finals','mashup payoff'),('Riff Off','competitive propulsion')],'Expands musical-adjacent performance territory.'),
T('coco','Coco',2017,'1h 45m','PG','Family memory detonator',['Warm','Colorful','Tender','Cathartic'],['Mexican Folk','Pop','Animation'],[4.2,4,4.1,5,5,4.2,5,4.6,5,5],'Music is literally the mechanism of memory, family, identity, and emotional release.','Less belt-driven than the strongest anchors.',['Remember Me','Un Poco Loco','Proud Corazón'],['moana','encanto','kpop'],'animated','original',['folk-pop','character vocal','ensemble'],3,62,5,5,2,['comfort','family','crying in a good way'],['lower belt intensity'],[('Remember Me','emotional architecture'),('Un Poco Loco','movement and play')],'Strengthens animation as a serious emotional-musical category.'),
