T('legallyblonde','Legally Blonde: The Musical',2007,'2h 2m','TV-PG','Pink, precise, propulsive',['Joyful','Belty','Funny','Triumphant'],['Pop','Broadway','Dance'],[5,5,5,4.3,4.6,4.8,5,5,4.8,5],'A relentless contemporary musical-theater machine with hooks, choreography, comedy, and escalating character payoff.','Stage capture aesthetics rather than cinematic polish.',['So Much Better','Omigod You Guys','Legally Blonde Remix'],['hairspray','meanGirls','newsies'],'stage-capture','filmed-stage',['pop belt','ensemble','comedy patter'],4,96,4.8,5,2,['high energy','belt-along','confidence'],['stage capture visuals'],[('So Much Better','pure belt propulsion'),('Legally Blonde Remix','late-show escalation')],'Likely high-value unseen title because it hits nearly every core dimension.'),
